	(text "CC/CV: 2.7489V nominal = 2.1*(1+30.9k/100k), 0.5A = 40mV/80mOhm. Termination enabled.\nMPP input setpoint5.376V AFTER ORing: usable with6V panel and9-16VDC; hot/weak panel performance must be measured.\nNTC is attached to CELL, not PCB. 6.04k/33.2k with103AT-2 targets roughly -5..40C; open/short inhibits charge.\nPrecharge/termination50mA; depleted-cell precharge is limited to30minutes. Validate recovery with selected cell.\nL201/C201 plus TPS63900 input capacitance form ONE charger filter: nominal10uH/14.7uF ->13.1kHz.\nMLCC effective capacitance, tolerances and loop stability remain required bench checks. Kelvin route R201 sense."
